## 2. PhairPlay — Apache License 2.0

**Location:** the Kotlin sources across `core/`, `platform/`, `airplay/`, `dlna/`
and `app/`, plus the Android resources, the Gradle build scripts, and the
documentation in `docs/`. (Before the multi-module split everything lived under
`app/src/main/`; the per-module layout is described in `settings.gradle.kts`.)
**Origin:** <https://github.com/mazer666/PhairPlay>
