opentvcast began as a fork of PhairPlay, which is the upstream of the closed
source "MuCast/幕映" receiver and of the GPLv3 project iMirror. We are
grateful for the AirPlay 2 protocol stack, the 247 unit tests, the CMake
native build, and the architecture decision records, all of which we inherit.

Apache-2.0 is one-way compatible with GPLv3, so this material may be
