## 3. Apple ALAC decoder — Apache License 2.0

**Location:** `airplay/src/main/cpp/alac/`
**Origin:** <https://github.com/macosforge/alac>
**License:** Apache License 2.0. Copyright (c) 2011 Apple Inc. All rights
reserved.
**Built as:** `libalac.so`

Used to decode the ALAC (Apple Lossless) audio that macOS sends for system
audio and music. Android TV devices have no hardware ALAC decoder, so a
software decoder is required. This component carries proper Apache-2.0 headers
in every file and needs no special handling.

